ile is fetched.'=>'Hitung unduhan meski hanya sebagian file yang diambil.','New users receive an email to set up their password.'=>'Pengguna baru menerima email untuk mengatur kata sandinya.','Allow customers to create an account'=>'Izinkan pelanggan membuat akun','Services'=>'Layanan','Intro'=>'Pengantar','Translatable Label'=>'Label yang Dapat Diterjemahkan','View order number %s'=>'Lihat nomor pesanan %s','This setting only works when product data is stored in the posts table.'=>'Pengaturan ini hanya berlaku jika data produk disimpan dalam tabel pos.','Uses much more performant queries to update the lookup table, but may not be compatible with some extensions.'=>'Menggunakan permintaan informasi yang jauh lebih efektif untuk memperbarui tabel pencarian, tetapi mungkin tidak kompatibel dengan beberapa ekstensi.','Optimized updates'=>'Pembaruan yang dioptimalkan','Orders are automatically put in the Refunded status when an admin or shop manager has fully refunded the order’s value after payment.'=>'Pesanan secara otomatis berstatus Dana dikembalikan jika admin atau manajer toko sepenuhnya mengembalikan dana sesuai nilai pesanan setelah pembayaran.','The order was canceled by an admin or the customer.'=>'Pesanan dibatalkan oleh admin atau pelanggan.','Draft orders are created when customers start the checkout process while the block version of the checkout is in place.'=>'Konsep pesanan dibuat setelah pelanggan memulai proses checkout saat versi blok checkout digunakan.','The customer’s payment failed or was declined, and no payment has been successfully made.'=>'Pembayaran pelanggan gagal atau ditolak dan pembayaran belum berhasil.','Order fulfilled and complete.'=>'Pesanan telah dipenuhi dan selesai.','Payment has been received (paid), and the stock has been reduced. The order is awaiting fulfillment.'=>'Pembayaran telah diterima (dibayar) dan stok telah dikurangi. Pesanan menunggu pemenuhan.','The order is awaiting payment confirmation. Stock is reduced, but you 