o','Ashanti'=>'Ashanti','Ahafo'=>'Ahafo','Manica'=>'Manica','Inhambane'=>'Inhambane','Gaza'=>'Gaza','Cabo Delgado'=>'Cabo Delgado','Western North'=>'Western North','Volta'=>'Volta','Savannah'=>'Savannah','Oti'=>'Oti','Bono'=>'Bono','Brong-Ahafo'=>'Brong-Ahafo','Upper West'=>'Upper West','Upper East'=>'Upper East','North East'=>'North East','Greater Accra'=>'Accra Raya','Bono East'=>'Bono East','%s() was called before the Action Scheduler data store was initialized'=>'%s() dipanggil sebelum penyimpanan data Penjadwal Tindakan dimulai','Finish setup'=>'Selesaikan penyiapan','Take payments via bank transfer.'=>'Izinkan pembayaran melalui transfer bank.','Take payments in cash upon delivery.'=>'Izinkan pembayaran dengan sistem bayar saat diterima.','Payfast'=>'Payfast','Shipment Tracking'=>'Pelacakan Pengiriman','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(dibuka di tab baru)','WooCommerce.com support'=>'Dukungan WooCommerce.com','Installed version not tested with active version of WooCommerce %s'=>'Versi yang terpasang tidak diuji dengan versi WooCommerce %s yang aktif','%1$s (update to version %2$s is available)'=>'%1$s (pembaruan ke versi %2$s tersedia)','Please visit the <a href="%s" target="_blank">subscriptions page</a> and renew to continue receiving updates.'=>'Harap kunjungi <a href="%s" target="_blank">halaman langganan</a> dan perbarui untuk terus menerima pembaruan.','If checked, free shipping would be available based on pre-discount order amount.'=>'Jika dicentang, pengiriman gratis akan tersedia berdasarkan jumlah pesanan pradiskon.','Apply minimum order rule before coupon discount'=>'Terapkan peraturan pemesanan minimum sebelum diskon kupon','Coupons discounts'=>'Kupon diskon','For further assistance with WooCommerce core, use the <a href="%1$s">community forum</a>. For help with premium extensions sold on WooCommerce.com, <a href="%2$s">open a support request at WooCommerce.com</a>.'=>'Untuk bantuan lebih lanjut terkait fungsi inti WooCommerce, gunakan <a href="%1$s">forum