lih tema','Get started'=>'Memulai','Mobile app'=>'Aplikasi seluler','Send targeted campaigns, recover abandoned carts and much more with Mailchimp.'=>'Kirimkan kampanye bertarget, pulihkan keranjang belanja yang ditinggalkan, dan lebih banyak lagi dengan Mailchimp.','Set up payments'=>'Siapkan pembayaran','Securely accept credit and debit cards with one low rate, no surprise fees (custom rates available). Sell online and in store and track sales and inventory in one place.'=>'Menerima kartu kredit dan debit dengan tarif rendah dan aman, tanpa biaya tak terduga (tersedia tarif khusus). Jual secara online dan offline serta lacak penjualan dan inventaris dalam satu tempat.','Choose the payment that you want, pay now, pay later or slice it. No credit card numbers, no passwords, no worries.'=>'Pilih pembayaran yang Anda inginkan, bayar sekarang, bayar nanti, atau dicicil. Tanpa nomor kartu kredit, tanpa kata sandi, tanpa khawatir.','Accept debit and credit cards in 135+ currencies, methods such as Alipay, and one-touch checkout with Apple Pay.'=>'Menerima kartu debit dan kartu kredit dalam lebih dari 135 mata uang, metode seperti Alipay, dan checkout satu sentuhan dengan Apple Pay.','Store connected successfully.'=>'Toko berhasil dihubungkan.','Connect your store'=>'Sambungkan ke toko Anda','Import your products'=>'Impor produk Anda','Close dialog'=>'Tutup dialog','Dismiss this notice'=>'Tutup pemberitahuan ini','Performance'=>'Performa','Order number'=>'Nomor pesanan','Average order value'=>'Nilai pesanan rata-rata','🎉 Congrats on adding your first product!'=>'🎉 Selamat telah menambahkan produk pertama Anda!','Amount'=>'Jumlahh','Search tax rates'=>'Cari tarif pajak','Gross sales'=>'Penjualan kotor','Customer type'=>'Jenis pelanggan','CBD and other hemp-derived products'=>'CBD dan produk asal hemp lainnya','Current page retrieval should be called on or after the `current_screen` hook.'=>'Pengambilan halaman saat ini harus dipanggil saat atau setelah kait `current_screen`.','Action that should be completed to connect Jetpack.'=>'Tindakan yang harus diselesaikan untuk menghubungkan Jetpack.','Plugin status.'=>'Status plugin.','Plugin name.'=>'Nama plugin.','Plugin slug.'=>'Slug plugin.','There was an error connecting to Square.'=>'Ada error saat menghubungkan ke Square.','IP address.'=>'Alamat IP.','A partial IP address can be passed and matching results will be returned.'=>'Alamat IP sebagian dapat diberikan dan hasil yang sesuai akan ditampilkan.','Invalid request. Please pass the match parameter.'=>'Permintaan tidak valid. Harap berikan parameter kesesuaian.','Task List'=>'Daftar Tugas','Disable'=>'Nonaktifkan','Profile Setup Wizard'=>'Wizard Penyiapan Prodil','WooCommerce Onboarding'=>'Penyiapan WooCommerce','Bookings'=>'Pemesanan','Memberships'=>'Keanggotaan','Physical products'=>'Produk fisik','Home, furniture, and garden'=>'Rumah, furnitur, dan taman','Food and drink'=>'Makanan dan minuman','Electronics and computers'=>'Elektronik dan komputer','Health and beauty'=>'Kesehatan dan kecantikan','Fashion, apparel, and accessories'=>'Mode, pakaian, dan aksesori','Analytics'=>'Analytics','[deleted]'=>'[dihapus]','Download your %1$s Report: %2$s'=>'Unduh Laporan %1$s Anda: %2$s','Download your %s Report'=>'Unduh Laporan %s Anda','Edit Product'=>'Sunting Produk','Edit Coupon'=>'Sunting Kupon','Edit Order'=>'Sunting Pesanan','If you need to enable or disable the task lists, please click on the button below.'=>'Jika Anda perlu mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkan daftar tugas, silakan klik tombol di bawah ini.','If you need to enable or disable the extended task lists, please click on the button below.'=>'Jika perlu mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkan daftar tugas tambahan, klik tombol di bawah ini.','There was an error connecting to WooCommerce.com. Please try again.'=>'Ada error saat menghubungkan ke WooCommerce.com. Harap coba lagi.','Jetpack is not installed or active.'=>'Jetpack tidak diinstal atau aktif.','The requested plugin `%s` could 