loning is forbidden.'=>'Kloning dilarang.','Deleted all active sessions, and %d saved carts.'=>'Semua sesi yang aktif telah dihapus, dan %d keranjang tersimpan.','This tool will delete all customer session data from the database, including current carts and saved carts in the database.'=>'Alat ini akan menghapus semua data sesi pelanggan dari database, termasuk keranjang saat ini dan keranjang yang disimpan dalam database.','If the payment was refunded via the API.'=>'Jika pembayaran dikembalikan melalui API.','Order total formatted for locale'=>'Total pesanan diformat untuk lokal','%1$s has been removed from your cart because it has since been modified. You can add it back to your cart <a href="%2$s">here</a>.'=>'%1$s telah dihapus dari keranjang Anda karena sejak itu telah dimodifikasi. Anda dapat menambahkannya kembali ke keranjang Anda <a href="%2$s">di sini</a>.','Name of the customer for the order'=>'Nama pelanggan untuk pesanan','URL to edit the order'=>'URL untuk menyunting pesanan','Blog id of the record on the multisite.'=>'ID blog catatan pada multisitus.','Access to Purchased Downloads'=>'Akses ke Unduhan yang Dibeli','Purchased Downloads'=>'Unduhan yang Dibeli','User roleShop manager'=>'Manajer Toko','Customer download permissions have been retained.'=>'Izin unduhan pelanggan telah dipertahankan.','User roleCustomer'=>'Pelanggan','%d permissions deleted'=>'%d izin dihapus','Used-up download permissions'=>'Izin unduhan yang digunakan','Removed customer "%s"'=>'Pelanggan  "%s" telah dihapus','Unable to create order.'=>'Tidak dapat membuat pesanan.','Removed payment token "%d"'=>'Token pembayaran yang dihapus "%d"','Removed access to downloadable files.'=>'Akses dihapus ke file yang dapat diunduh.','Personal data within order %s has been retained.'=>'Data pribadi dalam pesanan %s telah dipertahankan.','Removed personal data from order %s.'=>'Data pribadi dihapus dari pesanan %s.','This tool will delete expired download permissions and permissions with 0 